From b4a3009c1476d3d94d02ab903ca794e75e7b06af Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Otto Jung <otto.jung@vauplace.com>
Date: Sun, 27 Sep 2026 08:22:59 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] w-0f3a17 probe: the traversal's own per-slot index, and each
 pass's rank

Adds the per-pass ranks (cost, familiarity, rarity, band, quality) for
every candidate of a span, and a probe that reports, per canonical slot,
the index the lexical walk actually reads -- slots[k] is edge.matches
re-sorted by SlotAlt::contribution(word_count), not the shortlist's own
quality order -- against cap = affordable_opening_width(depth, 4000).

Still NOT FOR PUSH. --lib is 65 passed / 0 failed with the dump.
